# T21 Q12 in Quick Race: the post-race "Change track" offers the track's full options (laps,
# rivals, AI difficulty, items, weather, time), not only layout/mirror. Run with --autopilot (the
# AI drives; the script only uses the menus) and --unlock-all.
wait ui
wait screen title
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
wait screen main
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Quick Race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait screen trackSelect
0.3 nav keyboardA right            # Sofa Circuit
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # select → Choose car
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Time of day
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Weather
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Items
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # AI difficulty
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Rivals
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Laps
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left
0.3 nav keyboardA left             # → 1 lap (clamped)
0.6 shot qct_01_one_lap
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Choose car
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # → Car select
wait screen carSelect
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # race
wait finished
3.5 shot qct_02_results
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Change track
0.6 shot qct_03_results_change_focused
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
2.0 shot qct_04_change_track
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # the current track card → its options (focus on Start)
0.6 shot qct_05_options_start
0.3 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Items
0.6 shot qct_06_options_items
0.3 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up
0.3 nav keyboardA up               # Laps
0.6 shot qct_07_options_laps
1.0 exit
